abstract: >
  Inkwell is a self-hosted Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that gives
  AI agents persistent memory across sessions and projects. Markdown files
  serve as the source of truth, with a hybrid BM25 + local embedding search
  index and typed graph relations between entries.
